NNAAMMEE
     yyppiinniitt — create a YP server (master or slave)

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     yyppiinniitt --mm [_d_o_m_a_i_n_n_a_m_e]
     yyppiinniitt --ss _m_a_s_t_e_r___s_e_r_v_e_r [_d_o_m_a_i_n_n_a_m_e]
     yyppiinniitt --uu [_d_o_m_a_i_n_n_a_m_e]

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     yyppiinniitt may be used to set up a YP server, or to change the ypserver map.
     If _d_o_m_a_i_n_n_a_m_e is not given, the default domainname will be used.

     The options are as follows:

     --mm [_d_o_m_a_i_n_n_a_m_e]
             Set up a master YP server.

     --ss _m_a_s_t_e_r___s_e_r_v_e_r [_d_o_m_a_i_n_n_a_m_e]
             Set up a slave YP server.  _m_a_s_t_e_r___s_e_r_v_e_r must be a running YP
             master server.

     --uu [_d_o_m_a_i_n_n_a_m_e]
             Update the ypserver map on a YP master server, or create a new
             one if the old one has been deleted.

